<title>USA: Hugoton Energy reserves hit record in 1996.</title>
<headline>Hugoton Energy reserves hit record in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hugoton Energy Corp said Tuesday its year-end 1996 proved reserves increased to a record 322 billion cubic feet equivalent from 276 bcfe.</p>
<p>The company said the reserves consisted of 225.2 billion cubic feet of natural gas and 16.2 million barrels of oil, condensate and natural gas liquids.</p>
<p>Hugoton said the value of total proved reserves was $464 million at the end of 1996, up from $192 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Hugoton is an independent oil and natural gas company.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1/8 Tuesday at 11-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
